// Coverage: two voices on one staff (voice { } { }) — the upper voice gets
// stems up, the lower voice stems down, and they continue independent relative-
// octave chains. Guards multi-voice stem direction and layout.
title "Two-voice polyphony"
time 4/4
key c major
part m { clef treble }
section Main {
  m {
    voice { g'2 a | b4 c b a | } { c4 d e f | g2 g | } 
  }
}
form main { Main }
score main "two-voice-polyphony" { staff m }
